  "description": "YIGJUU crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 O12 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 5 O neighbors; Tb1C (Tb) has 5 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 5 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.607-3.607 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.79-105.62°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132O12Tb4.",
